      "heading": "Install",
      "content": "pip install ovos_tts_plugin_espeakng\n\nThe plugin needs the `espeak-ng` executable. Install it with:\n\napt-get install espeak-ng"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Configuration",
      "content": "Add this block to your OVOS configuration to select the plugin and a voice:\n\n  \"tts\": {\n    \"module\": \"ovos_tts_plugin_espeakng\",\n    \"ovos_tts_plugin_espeakng\": {\n      \"voice\": \"m1\"\n    }\n }"
